# Property 3: mana released by a dropped buff must regenerate even below the
# regen floor. Henk (orc-mage-seed4-gate, Concentration +3) casts Shield
# (holds its cost), then 30 Burning Hands aimed RIGHT into open floor (2 mana
# each, no hold; the recipe of tools/keys/mana-regen-cast.keys) so current mana
# sits below the floor, then drops Shield and waits by searching (no rest).
# Generated body: 30 x (m, @choose "Burning Hands", RIGHT).
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/gates/Options.Dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/orc-mage-seed4-gate.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/held-mana-floor.keys 4
